WEBVTT


00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:02.180
While you sleep, your eye is trading.

00:00:02.181 --> 00:00:03.781
No emotions, no days off,

00:00:03.782 --> 00:00:04.921
just execution.

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.100
An algorithm doesn't guess.

00:00:07.101 --> 00:00:09.301
It scans its signals and it executes

00:00:09.302 --> 00:00:10.401
all by rules.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:13.020
It reads data you never could.

00:00:13.021 --> 00:00:15.641
Thousands of price points every single second.

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.220
No fear, no f o m. O.

00:00:18.221 --> 00:00:19.541
The same discipline. At 3 a.

00:00:19.542 --> 00:00:20.881
M. As at the open,

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:26.000
a small edge compounded over thousands of trades becomes real returns.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:29.880
Want an algo trading for you? Comment the word algo.
